			<div class="content" id="post-content-3810135">
									

<p>I was thinking this was the SCP version of the Slumbering Prince at first, and I was a little disappointed. But I'm pleased to say it stands well on its own, regardless of comparison.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>how Twitty why the gods katyperry and potus contain more follow</p>
</blockquote>
<p><em>Relatable.</em></p>
<p>That said, I agree that I'm not sure why this is listed as being a former deity in the description; it seems like it should be taken as just an anomalous Twitter account that posts cognitohazards. Then the story of who this guy is and why he wants followers can come out via all the addenda and so forth.</p>

							</div>

								
					
