														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3810546">
									

<p>The way I see it, the Foundation wasn't sure exactly what it was before the events of Addendum A. After Hostile Takeover gets more information on the entity, the Foundation pieces together the current description from what they have. SCP-3532's tweets about followers both imply it had some sort of following in the past, and when it worked with the marketing company the accounts and contract were filled with religious terminology. Even still, the Foundation isn't one hundred percent sure on what's making the posts, which is why the description says they believe it was worshipped as a god, and recovered files suggest it lives in some other plane.</p>
<p>Thank you for the feedback and I'm glad you enjoyed the article!</p>

